1
00:00:00,290 --> 00:00:02,960
(Howard:)I wouldn't be the sidekick.
You'd be the sidekick.

2
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:05,790
(Raj:)Rat-Man is nobody's sidekick.

3
00:00:05,790 --> 00:00:07,450
(Howard:)Leonard, settle this.

4
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:09,700
(Howard:)Of the two of us, who's
the obvious sidekick?

5
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,100
(Raj:)Yeah, Leonard, who?

6
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,640
(Leonard:)12 years after high school,
and I'm still at the nerd table.

7
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:25,510
(Sheldon:)Aren't you slicing that
man's brain a little too thin?

8
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:32,390
(Amy:)It's too thin if I were making

9
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:34,550
(Amy:)a foot-long brain sandwich
at Quiznos.

10
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:39,330
(Amy:)For examination under a two-
photon microscope, it's fine.

11
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:45,170
(Sheldon:)Well, you're the expert.

12
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:49,170
(Sheldon:)If the correct way to do it
is the wrong way, then I yield.

13
00:00:49,170 --> 00:00:50,370
(Amy:)Very well.

14
00:00:50,370 --> 00:00:52,620
(Amy:)If you die and donate
your body to science,

15
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:54,670
(Amy:)I promise to slice your brain
like Canadian bacon.

16
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:56,640
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

17
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:58,240
(Amy:)Now, if you'll
excuse me,

18
00:00:58,250 --> 00:01:01,060
(Amy:)I have to take my temperature.

